	"description": "\n\u25a0 Classic Arcade Shooter\nEnjoy simple, fast-paced, and thrilling action inspired by classic 2D shooters.\n\n\u25a0 In-Combat Upgrade System\nFreely enhance attributes such as fire rate, attack power, projectile speed, and weapon types as you play.\n\n\u25a0 Diverse Enemies and Varied Attack Patterns\nUnique formations and a wide variety of enemy ships constantly appear, putting you in increasingly challenging situations.\n\n\u25a0 Stage-Based Progression\nComplete all 10 stages and face steadily increasing difficulty with each level.\n\n\u25a0 Strategic Life Management\nSurvive intense attacks by using your limited resources wisely, creating a challenging and rewarding experience.\n\n\u25a0 Four Difficulty Levels\nChoose from four difficulty settings, from beginner to advanced, and challenge yourself based on your skill level.\n\n\u25a0 Score Attack for High Replayability\nBeat your high score and keep pushing your limits.",
